{
  "id": 975,
  "description": "# 🪓⛏️🎣 **welcome!** 🧪🔥🍖\n\n###### We are masters of discipline whose hands remain untarnished by the stains of raid and combat. Our prowess is measured in challenges overcome, through which our members earn Guild Mastery experience. ONLOOKERS BEWARE: your weapons are meaningless here.\n\n\n## ✨️ __skill badge collection__\n\n# 🐕 ⛏️ ⛏️ ⛏️ 🔥 🪓 🪓 🪓 🎣 🎣 🎣 🍖 🍖 🍖\n\n- Badges collected: 14\n- Completionist progress: 6/22\n\n## 👑 __goals__\n- Level 70 Guild for Energizing Pool\n- Guild achievements list\n- Guild badge completionist status (collectively obtain every possible non-combat badge across all guild members)\n\n\n## 📝 __apply__\n\n- [x] ⚔️ Combat level 1\n- [x] 📊 150 Total level minimum\n- [x] 🎁 Contribute at least 500 items toward guild challenges within 1 week of joining\n###### Contribution to the stockpile is welcomed but not required\n\n\n## ⚠️ __please avoid__\n⚔️ Levelling-up your combat level\n\n###### Doing so will remove you from the guild\n\n🗡🤪 Applying when your combat level is 2 or higher, you silly clowns. Especially you combat pures! Booooo!\n\n## __note for banished/cursed classes__\n###### Happy to see your interest in applying to our guild, however you will be unable to participate in guild challenges &amp; stockpile due to your character&#039;s trade restrictions. Consider searching for a banished guild instead with fellow trade-locked classes. Cheers!",
